00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:46.210
Mistress Kate!

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:51.220
Give me your hand!

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:56.850
It seems I was born with a sturdy body!

00:01:59.890 --> 00:02:04.100
She cleared a large area of thorn trees
so we'd have somewhere to land,

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:08.770
then placed her pushcart full of
flowers and leaves there as a cushion.

00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:13.570
Did she plan this from the start in case
she couldn't operate the crane?

00:02:13.570 --> 00:02:18.780
Is there anything she doesn't think of?

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:21.370
Emilico, you're bleeding!

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:25.960
I've scratched my face!

00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:28.880
Forgive me, Mistress Kate!

00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:33.470
There's a river nearby.
Let's go wash it and get you patched up.

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:43.850
It's just a little cut on your head.
It's not very deep.

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:46.940
I really am a sturdy doll!

00:02:46.940 --> 00:02:50.570
But what about you,
Mistress Kate? You're not hurt?

00:02:50.570 --> 00:02:52.110
Kate is just fine.

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:57.240
I'm so glad! We're both safe now,
and we can still pass the test!

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:04.830
Only ten minutes left.

00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:09.790
They still have a long road ahead.

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:12.800
The bleeding stopped.

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:15.010
Then let's go!

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:23.600
Mistress Kate?

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:30.110
Don't tell me it's already too late.

00:03:30.110 --> 00:03:32.400
Mistress Kate...

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:35.280
You've been true to who you are.

00:03:35.280 --> 00:03:39.530
It's apparent from the way Patrick acted.

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:43.700
That's all Kate needs to be content.

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:45.790
It's over!

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:48.540
Not everything went as planned,

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:51.670
but I succeeded in the end.

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:58.970
This debut marks a major step for me.

00:03:58.970 --> 00:04:01.100
I had that incident in the hall.

00:04:01.100 --> 00:04:04.310
And the living dolls were
tougher than I thought.

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:07.730
I did foresee the
blossoming of John's power.

00:04:07.730 --> 00:04:10.650
Ricky was nearly flattened,

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:13.440
but that, too, was a needless concern.

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:17.990
A bit hasty, perhaps?

00:04:17.990 --> 00:04:22.280
The sootglass has not run out yet.

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:26.450
It would take me over ten minutes
from that point, and I know the way!

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:29.790
It's physically impossible
no matter how fast they run!

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:31.670
The writing is on the wall.

00:04:31.670 --> 00:04:35.300
You kids need but do as I say.

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:37.590
Now keep your mouths shut!

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:40.430
Then do as you please.

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:50.890
What's that sound?

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:56.070
"Check the upper level"?

00:04:56.070 --> 00:04:59.400
What's Allie talking about?

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:03.200
It's going as planned.
It's going as planned!

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:07.910
Come what may,
it must all fall into place.

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:11.750
I have the whole ending planned!

00:05:11.750 --> 00:05:15.000
And this one? I'm not sure.

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:19.340
Seeing this again, they seem so ordinary,
yet the information is flawless.

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:23.050
It's as if they know
they're being watched.

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:24.850
Don't tell me...

00:05:26.140 --> 00:05:28.850
What did I overlook?!

00:05:43.160 --> 00:05:46.240
Stopping by the river was a good idea!

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:50.160
I wonder where this river
comes from and where it goes.

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:56.840
We're on a hill, so perhaps it connects
to a waterway that supplies the house.

00:05:56.840 --> 00:05:59.250
It's just like you thought!

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:05.180
Yes, but converting the pushcart into
a boat was a fabulous idea, Emilico!

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:06.600
Very impressive.

00:06:06.600 --> 00:06:10.140
You really do never give up.

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:14.020
But this wouldn't have worked
without you, Mistress Kate!

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:16.480
Careful! There's a sharp turn.

00:06:21.570 --> 00:06:24.150
Kate! She can...

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:27.990
She can control soot!
Why has she not done so till now?

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:29.740
Did her power just awaken?

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:31.830
No! She was hiding it.

00:06:31.830 --> 00:06:34.210
She was always capable of it.

00:06:34.210 --> 00:06:37.000
Damn it! Why didn't I notice?

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:38.420
Her clothes!

00:06:38.420 --> 00:06:41.510
Your clothes didn't get dirty.

00:06:41.510 --> 00:06:44.590
You were so anxious
and emitting lots of soot,

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:48.050
but you controlled it
so you wouldn't get dirty.

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:53.770
You never gave up, Mistress Kate,
so there was no way I would, either!

00:06:53.770 --> 00:06:57.980
You're always carefully
watching Kate, aren't you?

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:04.650
This is dangerous! Let's get off!

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:06.570
Stay the course!

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:12.870
Emilico, do you know why I named you that?

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:18.790
It's true that living dolls are usually
given names that resemble their master's.

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:24.130
Shadows aren't supposed to care
what their living dolls are named.

00:07:25.510 --> 00:07:30.510
But I wanted you to be a unique
individual separate from Kate.

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:33.600
So, I gave you a unique name.

00:07:33.600 --> 00:07:38.560
Emilico, there's so much I wish
to tell you once the debut is over.

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:41.360
I'll tell you all my secrets.

00:07:44.070 --> 00:07:46.150
Jump out!

00:08:06.470 --> 00:08:09.090
Mistress Kate has arrived!

00:08:11.140 --> 00:08:13.560
Apologies. Kate's not very strong.

00:08:13.560 --> 00:08:17.940
I felt so happy cradled in your arms!

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:22.520
This way, please.

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:26.110
The others who passed
have already filed into the hall.

00:08:26.110 --> 00:08:28.400
You were the last to arrive.

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:37.080
If she could control soot
before the debut test,

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:38.790
why did she hide it?

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:41.460
What are you up to, Kate?

00:08:48.550 --> 00:08:51.340
Why is Master Ryan clapping?

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:53.430
Oh...

00:08:53.430 --> 00:08:56.430
Did it finally happen?

00:09:11.740 --> 00:09:14.490
Rum?

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:15.410
Rum.

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:20.660
Mistress Shirley! You remembered my name.

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:25.130
Forgive me for choosing my own name.

00:09:27.050 --> 00:09:30.840
The name Rum is all right with you?

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:33.050
I'm so glad.

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:35.850
I thought we'd make it to the exit.

00:09:35.850 --> 00:09:38.220
I was sure there was time.

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:43.480
But Mistress Shirley started slowing down.

00:09:43.480 --> 00:09:46.230
Though we had no hope
of making it in time,

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:50.530
I continued to hold her hand.

00:09:50.530 --> 00:09:57.200
And her gentle voice saying my name
remained ever in my mind.

00:09:57.200 --> 00:10:03.500
Happiness was right before me
if only I had opened my heart sooner.

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:09.340
I would have been able to
kiss her good night now.

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:45.120
I finally became your face, Mistress Kate!

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:47.130
When living dolls wear a portrait,

00:10:47.130 --> 00:10:51.300
they refrain from speaking and
express only their master's emotions.

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:54.630
Kate, you are free to mingle
with the other shadows.

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:59.640
However, you must not speak of
your soot powers with them.

00:10:59.640 --> 00:11:04.390
That is between the Star Bearers and
those in which such power has awakened.

00:11:04.390 --> 00:11:05.980
Understood.

00:11:05.980 --> 00:11:07.980
Any questions?

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:11.610
No. One need but obey the rules.

00:11:11.610 --> 00:11:13.610
How infuriating!

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:15.950
Let's go.

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:24.410
Congratulations to Kate,
the final candidate to pass.

00:11:32.800 --> 00:11:37.430
Everyone from the
children's wing is gathered here.

00:11:37.430 --> 00:11:39.180
Would you like a cup?

00:11:39.180 --> 00:11:40.850
Thank you.

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:43.350
What is it? It's so dark.

00:11:43.350 --> 00:11:46.520
It's a drink served only
to shadows with faces,

00:11:46.520 --> 00:11:49.480
in other words,
those who are deemed adults.

00:11:50.860 --> 00:11:52.780
It's so bitter!

00:11:52.780 --> 00:11:56.900
Once you get used to it,
you won't be able to get enough.

00:11:56.900 --> 00:12:00.950
Drink, and your worries shall vanish.

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:04.750
It's probably a drink called coffee.
It was mentioned in a book.

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:08.120
But Kate doesn't care for it.
She prefers tea.

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:11.460
It seems such a waste. Allow me!

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:14.840
But you didn't seem
to care for it, either.

00:12:14.840 --> 00:12:17.760
It's so bitter!

00:12:17.760 --> 00:12:20.390
Kate, congratulations!

00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:29.730
I am Maryrose! Our faces
are already well acquainted.

00:12:29.730 --> 00:12:32.520
Rosemary's shadow master!

00:12:33.650 --> 00:12:37.440
O most beauteous Kate,
our faces are on the same team,

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:41.990
so you shall become
quite close to Maryrose.

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:45.580
Should you have any questions,
let Maryrose guide you!

00:12:45.580 --> 00:12:48.750
Now be at ease.
It was a pleasure meeting you!

00:12:48.750 --> 00:12:52.960
She's a lady, right?
It's just, she seems so gallant.

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:54.500
Maryrose!

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:57.010
Don't spoil the children.

00:12:57.010 --> 00:12:58.470
Sarah.

00:12:58.470 --> 00:13:01.390
Congratulations, Kate. Well done.

00:13:01.390 --> 00:13:06.810
Sarah thought you a failure, but even
the lowest-ranked shadow passed.

00:13:06.810 --> 00:13:09.850
One gets shivers up the spine
with each visit here.

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:13.650
For it's not every day one gets
to visit Lord Grandfather's wing.

00:13:13.650 --> 00:13:17.900
But there will come a day when
Sarah shall be summoned here.

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:20.490
Of course, this is but the first floor.

00:13:20.490 --> 00:13:23.370
It may seem strange after
entering from the garden,

00:13:23.370 --> 00:13:25.660
but this is the ground level.

00:13:25.660 --> 00:13:29.120
As the lowest ranked,
you must work hard to move up.

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:33.380
For starters, you may use Louise
as an excellent example.

00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:36.250
Louise is at the top.

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:41.340
Here are the four pairs
that have grown up today.

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:45.800
Please give a hand to the newest
members of the children's wing.

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:49.430
Congratulations! Well done!

00:13:49.430 --> 00:13:51.350
Four pairs?

00:13:51.350 --> 00:13:53.400
Oh...

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:56.610
Emilico, you must be sad.

00:13:56.610 --> 00:14:00.610
Four of five pairs passed this time,
a most impressive feat.

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:04.320
And the single incompetent pair
that failed will be...

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:09.080
...discarded!

00:14:13.210 --> 00:14:15.580
Oh, what a joy to bask in this glory.

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:20.050
Louise is so beautiful that anyone
would want to be like her.

00:14:20.050 --> 00:14:24.510
How can they be so delighted
in the failure of their own kind?

00:14:24.510 --> 00:14:27.220
What happens to shadows who fail?

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:31.180
How should Patrick even feel, Ricky?

00:14:33.020 --> 00:14:37.060
No, one must learn on one's own.
Be confident, Patrick!

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:38.520
So it was Rum.

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:41.320
She seemed to be doing well,
but she'll be discarded?

00:14:41.320 --> 00:14:44.410
No! One cannot question
Shadows House's rules.

00:14:44.410 --> 00:14:46.530
Isn't that right, Shaun?

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:52.870
Let us adjourn to the garden!
It is time to be received in audience.

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:12.980
Kate.

00:15:12.980 --> 00:15:15.770
Now for an encounter
you shall never forget.

00:15:15.770 --> 00:15:19.610
Presenting the noblest of personages.

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:37.210
Lord Grandfather waved to me!

00:15:37.210 --> 00:15:40.670
Such a glorious sight!

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:46.930
So he's the root of all this evil.

00:15:55.140 --> 00:15:58.850
That dark drink they gave us...
Don't tell me--!

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:13.830
Forgive my intrusion.

00:16:13.830 --> 00:16:17.620
Let us see your faces.

00:16:26.590 --> 00:16:29.180
Lord Grandfather...

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:32.550
...here are the results.

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:37.060
Louise receives passing marks for
facial compatibility and soot volume.

00:16:37.060 --> 00:16:39.900
John's soot volume surpasses expectations,

00:16:39.900 --> 00:16:42.820
but his personality
is ill-fit for his face.

00:16:42.820 --> 00:16:48.240
Patrick is compatible with his face,
but his soot volume is poor.

00:16:48.240 --> 00:16:52.030
As you saw, my lord, Shirley
had yet to acquire a personality--

00:16:52.030 --> 00:16:55.200
a fundamental flaw.

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:59.710
I foresaw such outcomes based
on their pre-debut information.

00:16:59.710 --> 00:17:03.420
The living doll, Rum,
is inadequate as a face.

00:17:03.420 --> 00:17:07.630
It's believed that she never
gave her master a kiss good night.

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:12.300
Edward, let us test your knowledge.

00:17:12.300 --> 00:17:15.720
What is a shadow, and what is its purpose?

00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:21.020
A shadow is a form of morph, a parasitic
fairy skilled in mimicry and imitation.

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:24.400
We all once took this form.

00:17:24.400 --> 00:17:26.730
Lord Grandfather devised the process

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:30.820
by which morphs acquire
personalities and become shadows.

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:33.450
In stage one, morphs
are shown living dolls

00:17:33.450 --> 00:17:36.490
so they may recognize
and mimic the human form.

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:41.790
In stage two, a personality is acquired
by interacting with a living doll.

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:46.090
And in stage three, soot powers awaken
and unification takes place.

00:17:46.090 --> 00:17:49.970
In short, a face is acquired by
taking over the doll's body,

00:17:49.970 --> 00:17:53.470
creating a perfect being possessing soot
powers and transcending humankind.

00:17:53.470 --> 00:17:56.970
But if the shadow fails to
acquire a personality in stage two,

00:17:56.970 --> 00:18:01.020
we may infer that its
morph's life force was too weak.

00:18:01.020 --> 00:18:03.270
Shirley certainly fits that pattern.

00:18:03.270 --> 00:18:06.360
No wonder she withered on the vine.

00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:10.190
But to perish like soot
in the wind was a first.

00:18:10.190 --> 00:18:13.780
It was hilarious,
but one can't help but wonder.

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:17.660
Edward! Did you foresee that happening?

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:20.660
N-No, not like that!

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:23.460
I wished to entertain
you third-floor lords.

00:18:23.460 --> 00:18:26.290
And I tried to save the
trouble of discarding her

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:28.250
by having her in the debut.

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:33.260
A slight error on my part led to Shirley
bonding with her doll during the debut,

00:18:33.260 --> 00:18:38.310
and even though she was doomed to die,
her personality began to develop.

00:18:38.310 --> 00:18:41.730
That is why these
unforeseen events occurred,

00:18:41.730 --> 00:18:44.310
or so I believe.

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:49.070
Perhaps I went too far in staging
a shadow's death as some sort of show.

00:18:49.070 --> 00:18:52.650
It is only natural that
the failures be culled.

00:18:52.650 --> 00:18:56.870
We need but those who
prove useful to Lord Grandfather.

00:18:56.870 --> 00:19:00.240
The manner in which the debut
was held is another concern.

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:03.370
It led the faces to fret
over trivial matters.

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:08.380
Faces with ideas of their own may
cast doubt upon Shadows House.

00:19:08.380 --> 00:19:12.090
Of course, we can have them
drink Lord Grandfather's soot coffee

00:19:12.090 --> 00:19:13.510
to alter their thinking.

00:19:13.510 --> 00:19:15.300
That swiftly erases their memory,

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:18.180
filling them with
loyalty toward Grandfather.

00:19:18.180 --> 00:19:23.100
But what of shadows influenced
by the doubts of their faces?

00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:26.230
Grandfather's soot has
no effect on shadows.

00:19:26.230 --> 00:19:31.980
Indeed, the greatest risk lies in shadows
being influenced by a doll's defiance.

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:36.160
But if we use the coffee to make
faces loyal to Lord Grandfather,

00:19:36.160 --> 00:19:40.580
that will influence their shadows,
so you needn't be concerned.

00:19:40.580 --> 00:19:45.250
I've had Shirley's living doll, Rum,
drink the coffee to reset her memory.

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:48.170
She'll be repurposed as a veiled doll.

00:19:48.170 --> 00:19:52.670
I take great care that
malcontents do not take root in--

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:55.800
You think Ryan is worried
about such matters?!

00:19:55.800 --> 00:19:59.010
No one would dare defy us!

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:04.640
Forgive me. I shall take
more care from now on.

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:06.810
Enough about that.

00:20:06.810 --> 00:20:10.770
Now then, Kate, the lowest ranked of all,
was quite amusing.

00:20:10.770 --> 00:20:14.400
Her power awakened,
a laudable achievement.

00:20:16.490 --> 00:20:18.910
Edward.

00:20:18.910 --> 00:20:24.080
By using this debut as a proving ground
for the Shadows family's potential,

00:20:24.080 --> 00:20:27.960
you hastened a shadow's
awakening and more.

00:20:27.960 --> 00:20:32.960
From this day forth, we place
the children's wing in your care.

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:40.140
Let us see how you do.

00:20:41.720 --> 00:20:43.350
However!

00:20:43.350 --> 00:20:47.310
As judge, you failed but one pair,
and they were already goners.

00:20:47.310 --> 00:20:51.060
Such meager results will
never get you to the third floor.

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:55.150
Understood. I shall redouble my efforts.

00:20:59.450 --> 00:21:03.660
It's a shame we won't rise
to the third floor just yet.

00:21:03.660 --> 00:21:07.700
The debut was not to their satisfaction.

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:11.920
We must be of greater service
to Lord Grandfather.

00:21:11.920 --> 00:21:17.010
Ryan! That arrogant buffoon had the
nerve to interrupt Lord Grandfather.

00:21:17.010 --> 00:21:21.840
Why does Lord Grandfather
have such frivolous fools by his side?

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:25.100
I should be the one serving him.

00:21:25.100 --> 00:21:26.850
Those malcontents...

00:21:26.850 --> 00:21:30.940
Once I expose them,
Lord Grandfather will understand.

00:21:30.940 --> 00:21:36.230
Those third-floor wastrels
are out to destroy him!

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:39.530
In that case, I must catch her in the act.

00:21:39.530 --> 00:21:41.450
That malcontent...

00:21:41.450 --> 00:21:43.370
Kate!

00:21:46.490 --> 00:21:50.040
I've become quite efficient at cleaning.

00:21:50.040 --> 00:21:53.250
All that's left is to clean the bathroom.

00:21:54.380 --> 00:21:57.920
Wasn't it a shock what happened to Rum?

00:21:57.920 --> 00:22:00.510
You were close, weren't you?

00:22:00.510 --> 00:22:02.220
Yes.

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:03.890
That was unfortunate.

00:22:03.890 --> 00:22:08.390
But living dolls no longer of service
to Shadows House must be discarded.

00:22:08.390 --> 00:22:11.020
That's the way it is.

00:22:24.740 --> 00:22:28.450
<i>No ash, no, just shadow</i>

00:22:28.450 --> 00:22:32.830
<i>A no-"I" body, like a dolly</i>

00:22:32.830 --> 00:22:36.750
<i>I'm hollow, where'd I go?</i>

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:39.550
<i>Nobody knows</i>

00:22:39.550 --> 00:22:43.930
<i>A murky "I" with black-hole eyes</i>

00:22:43.930 --> 00:22:47.600
<i>A mimic, oh my! I'm in disguise?</i>

00:22:47.600 --> 00:22:50.140
<i>"Thank you"? Thank who?</i>

00:22:50.140 --> 00:22:53.770
<i>Every answer is true</i>

00:22:53.770 --> 00:22:57.400
<i>If I am no one</i>

00:22:57.400 --> 00:23:01.280
<i>And I can do nothing</i>

00:23:01.280 --> 00:23:04.860
<i>Is it a waste to keep living?</i>

00:23:04.860 --> 00:23:08.240
<i>Is it wrong to go on?</i>

00:23:08.240 --> 00:23:13.160
<i>What's missing here is me, me, me</i>

00:23:13.160 --> 00:23:15.750
<i>Without a self</i>

00:23:15.750 --> 00:23:20.340
<i>Swept away before anyone see, see, sees</i>

00:23:20.340 --> 00:23:23.170
<i>Like dust from the shelf</i>

00:23:23.170 --> 00:23:27.720
<i>Neither happy nor sad</i>

00:23:27.720 --> 00:23:30.560
<i>Don't feel good or bad</i>

00:23:30.560 --> 00:23:32.600
<i>Not up to snuff</i>

00:23:32.600 --> 00:23:38.150
<i>I can't even bluff</i>

00:23:38.150 --> 00:23:41.860
<i>Would you believe this stuff?</i>

